# EDGE_MODE=cloudflare (optional): Cloudflare's proxy (orange cloud) sits in
# front of this VPS. Imported into the global `servers` options of ../Caddyfile.
#
# Only peers inside Cloudflare's published ranges are trusted, and the client
# IP is read from CF-Connecting-IP (trusted_proxies_strict: right-most
# untrusted entry). Cloudflare's ranges, from https://www.cloudflare.com/ips/
# (ips-v4 and ips-v6), checked 2026-10: re-check them when enabling this mode
# and at least yearly. Lock the origin to the same ranges (ufw), otherwise
# anyone can bypass Cloudflare: docs/DEPLOYMENT.md §15.11.
protocols h1 h2 h3
trusted_proxies static 173.245.48.0/20 103.21.244.0/22 103.22.200.0/22 103.31.4.0/22 141.101.64.0/18 108.162.192.0/18 190.93.240.0/20 188.114.96.0/20 197.234.240.0/22 198.41.128.0/17 162.158.0.0/15 104.16.0.0/13 104.24.0.0/14 172.64.0.0/13 131.0.72.0/22 2400:cb00::/32 2606:4700::/32 2803:f800::/32 2405:b500::/32 2405:8100::/32 2a06:98c0::/29 2c0f:f248::/32
client_ip_headers CF-Connecting-IP
trusted_proxies_strict
